this model

 f(t1, w1, model="rw1", constr=FALSE)  + f(t2, w2, model="rw1",
constr=FALSE)

with the same hyperpar, should be

r1 = rep(1, 8)
r2 = rep(2, 8)

f(t1, w1, model="rw1", replicate = r1, nrep=2) +
  f(t2, w2, copy="t1", replicate = r2)

please simulate data with near exact Gaussian observations and check
that its correct.

for replicated models, then 'extraconstr' is defined on the un-
replicated models, and then the constr is replicated interally.

H

